<title>INDIA: India, Pakistan foreign ministers end talks.</title>
<headline>India, Pakistan foreign ministers end talks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The foreign ministers of India and Pakistan ended talks in New Delhi on Wednesday and Pakistan's negotiator said he was &quot;very satisfied&quot;.</p>
</text>
